    return schema_rt.fixed_file(BenchBitsFixedLayoutBytes(), BenchBitsFixedHash, body, length(values))

// BenchBitsFixedDecode reads a TRUSTED form-3 file of BenchBits records written by this
// build's own layout (BenchBits, §2), asserting the header and every record
// hash. It is not a read of untrusted data: BenchBitsFixedLoad is the strict
// read and BenchBitsFixedLoadTolerant the tolerant one (docs/SPEC-TABLES.md §6.5).
